{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">華潤醫療截至六月底止中期按年少賺近兩成二，純利2.64億元人民幣，中期息每股派5分人民幣，與上年度同期相同。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入跌百分之1，至44.78億元人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T23:20:58.651834+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}